- SpType (spectral type): Luminosity class indicated by Roman numerals or suffixes (e.g., III for giants, IV for subgiants, V for main sequence/dwarfs). This is a very strong indicator.
- Amag (absolute magnitude): Intrinsic brightness; giants are generally brighter (lower Amag) than dwarfs of the same spectral type.

